<title>UK: Sumitomo Realty sets 10 billion yen bond.</title>
<headline>Sumitomo Realty sets 10 billion yen bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Daiwa Europe.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SUMITOMO REALTY &amp; DEVELOPMENT CO LTD</p>
<p> AMT     10 BLN YEN   COUPON     2.40	MATURITY    16.JAN.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.675   PAY DATE   *16.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    100.075   PAY FREW    ANNUAL</p>
<p> LISTING    NONE	DENOMS (M) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  JAPAN     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> NOTES     *SHORT FIRST COUPON TO 05.MAR.97.</p>
<p>		SHORT LAST  COUPON TO 16.JAN.01.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
